+ASCENT is the deterministic composition
+\begin{equation}
+  Z_s=W_s(X),\qquad
+  E_{s,Q}=R_s(Q,Z_s),\qquad
+  \widehat{Y}_{m,s}=D_{M_m}\!\left(P(Q,E_{s,Q})\right),
+  \label{eq:ascent-contract}
